When asked to run, start, test or record the app, the page or the demo script, follow `.claude/skills/run-demo/SKILL.md`.
Set `CAPITAL_DB=capital_arad` in `.env` before any `run_demo.py --reset`: the reset deletes every session in the database it runs on.
